From dca72be46572050ed2b036f5da2a72484b556b22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 09:27:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD selected-agent slash command dispatch so provider
 commands run as raw resumes

Route slash-prefixed selected-agent chat input through the backend command interface instead of ordinary prompt sends so provider commands such as /status and /fork preserve their command semantics. Codex command output updates the stored thread id so command-created threads remain the resume target for later messages.
